# REQUIRED before deploy:
# 1) Create free Postgres: https://neon.tech → New Project → copy connection string
# 2) Vercel → Settings → Environment Variables → set DATABASE_URL to that string
#    Example shape: postgresql://user:pass@ep-xxxx.neon.tech/neondb?sslmode=require
# 3) Redeploy ELAH_BANKING_SYSTEM

